      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "## SAHOOL Platform SLO Definitions | تعريفات أهداف مستوى الخدمة\n\n| Metric | Target | Window | Description |\n|--------|--------|--------|-------------|\n| **Availability** | 99.9% | 30 days | Services must be available 99.9% of the time |\n| **P99 Latency** | <500ms | 5 min | 99th percentile response time under 500ms |\n| **Error Rate** | <0.1% | 30 days | Less than 0.1% of requests should fail with 5xx |\n| **Error Budget** | 43.2 min/month | 30 days | Maximum allowed downtime per month |\n\n### SLO Tiers | مستويات الخدمة\n- **Tier 1 (Critical)**: field-management-service, advisory-service, irrigation-smart, user-service\n- **Tier 2 (Important)**: notification-service, billing-core, weather-service, task-service\n- **Tier 3 (Standard)**: All other services\n\n### Burn Rate Thresholds | حدود معدل الاستهلاك\n\n| Window | Burn Rate | Time to Exhaustion | Action |\n|--------|-----------|-------------------|--------|\n| 1h | >36x | <2 hours | Page on-call immediately |\n| 1h | >14.4x | <6 hours | Page on-call |\n| 6h | >6x | <1 day | Notify team |\n| 24h | >1x | <30 days | Monitor closely |\n\n### Error Budget Formula | صيغة ميزانية الأخطاء\n```\nError Budget Remaining % = ((SLO Target - Actual Error Rate) / (1 - SLO Target)) * 100\n\nWhere SLO Target = 99.9% (0.001 error budget)\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.0",
      "title": "SLO Reference | مرجع أهداف الخدمة",
      "type": "text"
    }
